y\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Gooding County came in under 90% of normal in June to July in 45 of the 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair of months. In 2025 the middle ran at 34% of normal for May to June and 30% for June to July. The open 2026 year has every published pair under 90% on the middle so far, with May to June at 27%. Grid 27662 had its driest year in 2013 at 43% of normal.</p>"}
